  "fields": {
    "name": "ShardSetsBase<TConfiguration>.ShardSetReadFirst QueryAsync family",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "text",
    "contract": "ShardSetsBase<TConfiguration>.ShardSetReadFirst exposes QueryAsync as a fan-out read-first query contract. The family accepts a Query, its DbParameterCollection, a thread-safe result handler, and optionally caller data. Its variants select either every shard in the shard set or the shards supplied by ShardsValues, and independently omit or name the parameter whose shard identifier is set for each target. Each variant completes as Task<TModel> with the first non-null model produced by a target shard."
  },
